<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><title>Demo Cinema — Aaryan Patel</title><meta name="description" content="Four concise narrated engineering demonstrations with captions and live-lab links." /></head><body><div class="evidence-page"><header class="lab-topbar"><a class="lab-wordmark" href="/"><span>AP</span><strong>Demo Cinema</strong></a><nav><a href="/labs/">Laboratories</a><a href="/benchmarks/">Benchmarks</a><a href="/papers/">Papers</a><a aria-current="page" href="/cinema/">Cinema</a></nav><a class="lab-back" href="/tours/">Proof tours ↗</a></header><main class="evidence-shell"><section class="evidence-hero"><div><p class="evidence-kicker">FOUR FILMS / CAPTIONED / UNDER ONE MINUTE</p><h1>See the claim.<br />Then break it.</h1></div><p>Each film is a fast orientation, not evidence by itself. Captions, transcript-level narration, and a direct route into the live system keep the demonstration accessible and inspectable.</p></section><div class="evidence-titlebar"><h2>Demo reels</h2><p>Real project architecture and measured boundaries, compressed for a first-pass recruiter review.</p></div><section class="cinema-grid">{films.map((film) => <article class="cinema-card"><small>{film.lab}</small><video class="cinema-screen" controls preload="metadata" poster={film.poster}><source src={film.video} type="video/mp4" /><track kind="captions" src={film.captions} srclang="en" label="English" default />Your browser does not support HTML video.</video><h2>{film.title}</h2><p>{film.summary}</p><span><a href={film.labUrl}>OPEN LIVE LAB →</a></span></article>)}</section></main></div></body></html>
